          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Welcome, here’s what’s new for you this week inside the Baseball Industry Network."
          }
        },
        "text_y7BfgA": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<p>This exclusive member space is reserved for <strong>Premier</strong> and <strong>Elite</strong> members — the professionals shaping the future of the game. Inside, you’ll unlock <strong>premium insights</strong>, <strong>career-changing mentorship</strong>, and <strong>behind-the-scenes access</strong> to the people and opportunities driving baseball forward.</p><p>From <strong>front office strategies</strong> and <strong>player development innovations</strong> to <strong>scouting intelligence</strong> and <strong>business leadership resources</strong>, this is where knowledge meets connection — and where careers are built.</p><p><strong>Our Mission:</strong><br/>Deliver a <strong>world-class, connected experience</strong> that empowers members to grow, advance, and lead. Whether you're chasing your next role, launching a project, or building your network — the Baseball Industry Network is your competitive advantage.</p><p><strong>Ready to Level Up?</strong><br/>Join <strong>Premier</strong> or <strong>Elite Membership</strong> today to gain full access to exclusive content, mentorship, events, and insider tools that you won’t find anywhere else.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
